 committing to at least 90 days for optimal results.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggjhL2ttWiu_text","label":"ggjhL2ttWiu_text","default":"<p>Wellness Nest is generally well-tolerated. Some men experience mild digestive adjustment during the first few days. This typically resolves within 3-5 days.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggrHHYhxxS4_text","label":"ggrHHYhxxS4_text","default":"<p>If you're on blood thinners, blood pressure medication, or diabetes medication, please consult your healthcare provider first.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggJbZr565_u_text","label":"ggJbZr565_u_text","default":"<p>We offer a 90-day \"Feel The Difference\" guarantee. Full refund, no questions asked, even if the bottle is empty.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggmO4sNTttZ_text","label":"ggmO4sNTttZ_text","default":"<p>Yes! All orders ship in plain, unmarked packaging.</p>"}],
